B.a4t=s(["This is a casual entertainment game using virtual chips. Virtual chips may be purchased with real money, but cannot be exchanged for, redeemed as, or withdrawn into any real currency, cash, or goods. Purchases and ads are only used to obtain or restore in-game progress.","We do not collect your real name or address. To provide game services we may process limited temporary data (e.g. local game progress).","If advertising is enabled, ad partners may process device advertising identifiers (GAID/AAID) per platform policy to serve personalized ads. See third-party policies for details."],t.s)
